[{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2706275590","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/103498#issuecomment-2706275590","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/103498","id":2706275590,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc6hTn0G","user":{"login":"bruvzg","id":7645683,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjc2NDU2ODM=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/7645683?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/bruvzg","html_url":"https://github.com/bruvzg","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bruvzg/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bruvzg/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bruvzg/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bruvzg/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bruvzg/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bruvzg/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bruvzg/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bruvzg/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bruvzg/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-03-07T12:00:43Z","updated_at":"2025-03-07T12:00:43Z","body":"> Unfortunately, the larger bundled language list increases binary size quite a bit. This is the size of a stripped Linux x86_64 release export template with production=yes lto=full\r\n\r\nI guess we can try storing it compressed, like we do with editor docs. I will try it later.","author_association":"MEMBER","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2706275590/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2706289484","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/103498#issuecomment-2706289484","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/103498","id":2706289484,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc6hTrNM","user":{"login":"akien-mga","id":4701338,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjQ3MDEzMzg=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/4701338?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga","html_url":"https://github.com/akien-mga","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-03-07T12:07:49Z","updated_at":"2025-03-07T12:09:13Z","body":"I wonder whether we need all these languages in `core`, or if we could make it `editor` only. Especially names of languages and countries, etc.\r\n\r\nThis also brings up the question of localizing all these strings, and honestly I wouldn't want to add thousands of languages and country names to our docs to localize. It's probably best left to users to do on a case by case basis, as the vast majority of projects would support max 10 languages, so they can put those strings in their own UI without relying on the ones we hardcode.\r\n\r\nFor `core` we could possibly just the use of any arbitrary language code and just fail if it doesn't exist? But the `editor` tooling would help users actually select language codes and countries that are recognized.","author_association":"MEMBER","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2706289484/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2706297472","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/103498#issuecomment-2706297472","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/103498","id":2706297472,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc6hTtKA","user":{"login":"bruvzg","id":7645683,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjc2NDU2ODM=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/7645683?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/bruvzg","html_url":"https://github.com/bruvzg","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bruvzg/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bruvzg/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bruvzg/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bruvzg/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bruvzg/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bruvzg/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bruvzg/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bruvzg/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bruvzg/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-03-07T12:11:50Z","updated_at":"2025-03-07T12:11:50Z","body":"> I wonder whether we need all these languages in core, or if we could make it editor only. Especially names of languages and countries, etc.\r\n\r\nFunctions for getting names from codes are public `TranslationServer` API, so removing it from code will be breaking change.\r\n\r\n> This also brings up the question of localizing all these strings, and honestly I wouldn't want to add thousands of languages and country names to our docs to localize. It's probably best left to users to do on a case by case basis, as the vast majority of projects would support max 10 languages, so they can put those strings in their own UI without relying on the ones we hardcode.\r\n\r\nIf we want to have it localized, it's more reasonable to bring it the full ICU localization database (which is 35 MB).","author_association":"MEMBER","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2706297472/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2706339434","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/103498#issuecomment-2706339434","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/103498","id":2706339434,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc6hT3Zq","user":{"login":"akien-mga","id":4701338,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjQ3MDEzMzg=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/4701338?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga","html_url":"https://github.com/akien-mga","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-03-07T12:33:52Z","updated_at":"2025-03-07T12:34:45Z","body":"> > I wonder whether we need all these languages in core, or if we could make it editor only. Especially names of languages and countries, etc.\r\n> \r\n> Functions for getting names from codes are public `TranslationServer` API, so removing it from code will be breaking change.\r\n\r\nWe could maybe leave that one unchanged (not add more languages to it, unless explicitly requested), and have another version that's complete and editor-only.\r\n\r\nWe could maybe also provide a way for users to add their own mappings, so if they want to support a language or country code that's not part of our database, they can add it. So we don't need to play catch with standards (and possibly geopolitics), and users can decide for themselves what they want to support.\r\n\r\nOverall, my main concern is on the significant increase in binary size for the export template (that affects everyone) for a use case that's so far highly theoretical and only affects one user who wants to use Toki Pona that's not in the list.","author_association":"MEMBER","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2706339434/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2706392052","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/103498#issuecomment-2706392052","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/103498","id":2706392052,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc6hUEP0","user":{"login":"bruvzg","id":7645683,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjc2NDU2ODM=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/7645683?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/bruvzg","html_url":"https://github.com/bruvzg","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bruvzg/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bruvzg/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bruvzg/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bruvzg/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bruvzg/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bruvzg/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bruvzg/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bruvzg/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bruvzg/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-03-07T12:55:30Z","updated_at":"2025-03-07T12:55:42Z","body":"With compression, it's about 125 KiB difference.\r\n\r\n> We could maybe also provide a way for users to add their own mappings, so if they want to support a language or country code that's not part of our database, they can add it. So we don't need to play catch with standards (and possibly geopolitics), and users can decide for themselves what they want to support.\r\n\r\nThis is already part of this PR, custom codes can be added in the project setting (and via locale selection dialog).\r\n\r\n> We could maybe leave that one unchanged (not add more languages to it, unless explicitly requested), and have another version that's complete and editor-only.\r\n\r\nMaintaining two lists will be a mess, so not sure about it. But it's probably reasonable to remove all 639-3 codes and keep only 639-2 by default, since any codes can be added for a specific project, it won't be an issue.","author_association":"MEMBER","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2706392052/reactions","total_count":1,"+1":1,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2706547232","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/103498#issuecomment-2706547232","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/103498","id":2706547232,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc6hUqIg","user":{"login":"bruvzg","id":7645683,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjc2NDU2ODM=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/7645683?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/bruvzg","html_url":"https://github.com/bruvzg","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bruvzg/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bruvzg/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bruvzg/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bruvzg/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bruvzg/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bruvzg/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bruvzg/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bruvzg/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bruvzg/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-03-07T14:11:35Z","updated_at":"2025-03-07T14:11:35Z","body":"Let's split it for now, I have reverted lists set (+ \"tok\", compression, and both alpha 2 and 3 codes stored), but with new UI and ability to add custom codes.","author_association":"MEMBER","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2706547232/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3095230241","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/103498#issuecomment-3095230241","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/103498","id":3095230241,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc64fXch","user":{"login":"bruvzg","id":7645683,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjc2NDU2ODM=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/7645683?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/bruvzg","html_url":"https://github.com/bruvzg","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bruvzg/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bruvzg/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bruvzg/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bruvzg/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bruvzg/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bruvzg/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bruvzg/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bruvzg/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bruvzg/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-07-21T05:10:22Z","updated_at":"2025-07-21T05:10:22Z","body":"Added support for 3-digit numeric country codes, so it should address https://github.com/godotengine/godot-proposals/issues/12212","author_association":"MEMBER","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3095230241/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3110096401","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/103498#issuecomment-3110096401","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/103498","id":3110096401,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc65YE4R","user":{"login":"KoBeWi","id":2223172,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjIyMjMxNzI=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/2223172?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/KoBeWi","html_url":"https://github.com/KoBeWi","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KoBeWi/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KoBeWi/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KoBeWi/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KoBeWi/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KoBeWi/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KoBeWi/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KoBeWi/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KoBeWi/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KoBeWi/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-07-23T20:38:21Z","updated_at":"2025-07-23T20:48:41Z","body":"Why is this dialog so wide?\r\n<img width=\"1195\" height=\"163\" alt=\"image\" src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/b13f6e88-70ae-4bc7-bdef-2dda143df7a5\" />\r\nThe Code and Name could be placed in a 2x2 grid and the warning can be autowrapped.\r\n\r\nFor the search results it would be nice if the entry showed by default.\r\n<img width=\"532\" height=\"149\" alt=\"image\" src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/784868ef-0d7f-4b6e-b60a-59b1ba24532c\" />\r\nOtherwise it's not really obvious that you have to search to see anything.\r\n<img width=\"528\" height=\"191\" alt=\"image\" src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/0d78b6e4-930b-4cb0-abf1-4d3a64da9862\" />\r\nAlternatively, the LineEdit's placeholder could tell that. Right now it just repeats the above label 🙃\r\nEDIT:\r\nAlso some Show All toggle might be useful, otherwise you need to know what to search for. Though I guess if you don't know then you don't need it 🤔","author_association":"MEMBER","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3110096401/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3110219396","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/103498#issuecomment-3110219396","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/103498","id":3110219396,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc65Yi6E","user":{"login":"KoBeWi","id":2223172,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjIyMjMxNzI=","avatar_url":"https://av